<<if $ch15_toma_carried_tobin>>
    Hull_captain as "Hollowmere wright" [smile]: Outside the Level, are you? Welcome aboard. So's everyone on this hull. #line:ch15_heresy_hollowmere_001
<<else>>
    Hull_captain as "Hollowmere wright" [neutral]: You came in off the sea. Sit. We'll hear it when you're ready. #line:ch15_heresy_hollowmere_002
<<endif>>
